68
00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:49.980
What do we mean by that, or what might we interpret from that?

69
00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:55.380
When we think about photography, we're not simply thinking about photography in

70
00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:59.670
