82
00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:09.360
new ways of exploring what we do with images, how we build representations,

83
00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:12.300
how we build narratives, and so on.

84
00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:18.510
So we would say in our program philosophy, we have an expanded fluid approach

85
00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:23.250
unrestricted by conventions of material, medium, format, discipline, or genre.

86
00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:31.020
Our students in our program, and our staff as well, are working across all

