94
00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:05.190
in relation to ideas that the image opens up for us.

95
00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:11.190
This allows us to engage in an exploration of positions, perspectives, and

96
00:08:11.341 --> 00:08:16.920
pleasures of the photographic image, and encourages us to

97
00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:22.860
